  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {犯罪|はんざい}を{阻止|そし}する - to prevent a crime\n- {計画|けいかく}を{阻止|そし}する - to stop a plan\n- {侵入|しんにゅう}を{阻止|そし}する - to prevent intrusion\n- {進行|しんこう}を{阻止|そし}する - to stop the progress\n\nUSAGE:\n{阻止|そし} emphasizes the act of stopping or preventing something from happening, while {妨害|ぼうがい} emphasizes interference or obstruction.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {妨害|ぼうがい} - obstruction, interference\n- {抑止|よくし} - deterrence (preventing through threat)\n- {防止|ぼうし} - prevention (more general)",
